t="v1" begin="01:44.420" end="01:50.030"><span begin="01:44.420" end="01:44.810">If </span><span begin="01:44.810" end="01:45.080">they </span><span begin="01:45.080" end="01:45.470">see </span><span begin="01:45.470" end="01:45.860">it </span><span begin="01:45.860" end="01:46.220">when </span><span begin="01:46.220" end="01:46.490">you're </span><span begin="01:46.490" end="01:47.270">sleeping</span><span begin="01:47.270" end="01:47.270">, </span><span begin="01:47.270" end="01:47.810">make </span><span begin="01:47.810" end="01:48.050">them </span><span begin="01:48.050" end="01:49.760">leave </span><span begin="01:49.760" end="01:50.030">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.030" end="01:56.030"><span begin="01:50.030" end="01:50.120">And </span><span begin="01:50.120" end="01:50.450">I </span><span begin="01:50.450" end="01:50.930">can't </span><span begin="01:50.930" end="01:51.470">even </span><span begin="01:51.470" end="01:52.040">see </span><span begin="01:52.040" end="01:52.340">if </span><span begin="01:52.340" end="01:52.700">it's </span><span begin="01:52.700" end="01:53.300">all </span><span begin="01:53.300" end="01:54.470">there </span><span begin="01:54.470" end="01:55.340">anymore </span><span begin="01:55.340" end="01:56.000">so</span><span begin="01:56.000" end="01:56.030">…</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.240" end="02:01.700"><span begin="01:56.240" end="01:56.540">You're </span><span begin="01:56.540" end="01:56.870">too </span><span begin="01:56.870" end="01:57.620">mean</span><span begin="01:57.620" end="01:57.650">, </span><span begin="01:57.650" end="01:57.920">I </span><span begin="01:57.920" end="01:58.400">don't </span><span begin="01:58.400" end="01:59.150">like </span><span begin="01:59.150" end="01:59.720">you</span><span begin="01:59.720" end="02:00.410">, </span><span begin="02:00.410" end="02:00.500">f</span><span begin="02:00.500" end="02:00.500">*</span><span begin="02:00.500" end="02:00.560">ck </span><span beg